      <slug></slug>
      <title>Deploying sssd</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>CrossDistro devroom</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The complexity of configuring client authentication with Kerberos or LDAP is well known. With sssd the whole process has been simplified. We are going to take a look at the framework and supported identity and authentication provides. Some examples will show the capability of sssd.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
